        "original_id": "6e07d18c-80bc-5e37-81eb-b25f743f817d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mikhail Glinka\n- Products: Kamarinskaya\n- Concepts: Russian traditional folk dance, Russian classical music\n\nFacts:\n- Mikhail Ivanovich Glinka was born on 1 June 1804 and died on 15 February 1857.\n- Mikhail Glinka was the first Russian composer to gain wide recognition within Russia.\n- Mikhail Glinka is often regarded as the fountainhead of Russian classical music.\n- Kamarinskaya is a Russian traditional folk dance.\n- Kamarinskaya is mostly known today as the title of a composition by Mikhail Glinka.",
